# ==========================================
# 6. Trained Model Artifacts (regenerate, do not commit)
# ==========================================
# Phase 2 XGBoost / Logistic Regression models. Rebuild by running
# notebooks/02_xgboost.ipynb on Colab/Kaggle; the metrics and tables in
# xgboost/ are the committed evidence. Version model binaries with DVC
# (Phase 6), never with Git.
xgboost/xgb_model*.json
xgboost/*.joblib
xgboost/*.pkl

# ==========================================
# 7. Monitoring Caches (regenerate, do not commit)
# ==========================================
# Intermediate feature cache built by scripts/run_monitoring_backtest.py.
# The per-step CSVs in results/monitoring/ are the committed evidence.
results/monitoring/features_cache.joblib
